A publish without a collection or photos, as the plugin sends for a
renamed or moved collection, updates the notes' lightroom-path lines to
match the service's collections.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "publish",
	"service": [
		{
			"id": 10,
			"path": [
				"Trips",
				"Recent: 2026"
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 11,
			"path": [
				"Trips",
				"Other"
			]
		}
	]
}
-- vault/Galleries/Other.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 11
lightroom-path: Trips/Other
---
-- vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Sunset
-- want/response.json --
{
	"protocol": 5
}
-- want/log --
updated the collection path of 1 note
-- want/vault/Galleries/Other.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 11
lightroom-path: Trips/Other
---
-- want/vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: "Trips/Recent: 2026"
---

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Sunset
